      "AMY: Rose, we’re coming in!\nAMY: Honey, Aisha’s here.\nROSE: Hi Aisha!\nAISHA: Salut petit amour.",
      "AMY: Please, I don’t want you to feel overwhelmed. Think of this as a loose guide: basic schedule, emergency contacts, a list of where things are…\nAMY: All phone numbers you’ll ever need. Even her therapist...some blank pages for you to fill in and make it yours...\nAISHA: Thank you.\nAMY: Ok...",
      "ROSE: No.\nAISHA: Your mommy made this just for you. Don't you want to eat the healthy food Mommy made?\nROSE: I don’t want it.\nAISHA: Encore en français. Again in french. Je ne-",
      "AMY: Sorry I’m late! Things got crazy.\nAISHA: Rose is in bed.\nAMY: Everything was smooth. No tantrums?\nAISHA: None at all.",
      "MARIATOU: Nooo Kofi!\nKOFI: She in America. Hi Mommy! Sing AYO\nAISHA: Oh my baby, my little baby, who can calm you down? Oh my baby, my little baby who can calm you down and bring you to Saloum--"
    ]
